  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Shen Qi is a Gu Immortal of Shen clan who competes in speed against Zeng Luo Zi as the group flees through the sea during Shen Cong Sheng’s ambush on Miao Ming Shen’s party. He joins Shen Tan and Ren Xiu Ping in chasing Tong Hua, Zeng Luo Zi, and Chu Ying once they break out of the sea into the sky. When Shen Cong Sheng wakes inside Dragon Whale Paradise, having died in what proves to be an illusion, and asks Miao Ming Shen’s side how long they have been awake, Shen Qi answers that they too had only just woken.",
      "chapters": [
        1889
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_shen_clan",
        "char_zeng_luo_zi",
        "char_shen_cong_sheng",
        "char_miao_ming_shen",
        "char_shen_tan",
        "char_ren_xiu_ping",
        "char_tong_hua",
        "loc_dragon_whale_paradise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Chu Ying ignores Ren Xiu Ping’s demand for an explanation, takes another mission from the Merit Obelisk, and vanishes, Shen Qi shouts in anger after him.",
      "chapters": [
        1891
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "anger-at-chu-yings-arrogance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_merit_obelisk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Dragon Whale Paradise, Shen Qi is named in the first of two groups, with Shen Cong Sheng, Shen Tan, Shen Xiao, Shen Nai He, Ren Xiu Ping, and Tong Hua, set apart from Miao Ming Shen’s group.",
      "chapters": [
        1892
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-group-inside-the-paradise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shen_xiao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Chu Ying laughs off Shen Shang’s offer to join Shen clan, Shen Qi and Shen Xiao warn him not to be too arrogant and fly out to stand beside Shen Cong Sheng and Shen Shang. Shen Qi is the Shen clan Gu Immortal who, after a few missions, brings back the information about regret crying sea that lets Shen Cong Sheng guess the demonic immortal trapped there is Ancestor Shen Shang.",
      "chapters": [
        1906
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "finding-regret-crying-sea",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shen_shang"
      ]
    }
  ],
